{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_15103240","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15103240","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:6:1510324001:0":{"text":"梅林女士，无论再强调多少遍，我的回答都一样。","source_cn":"梅林女士，无论再强调多少遍，我的回答都一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCED1DBAF1E870CDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1510324002:0":{"text":"早在呼临建城之前，我们就在信仰丰饶神赛图恩，他赐予我们肥沃的土地和生生不息的麦田。","source_cn":"早在呼临建城之前，我们就在信仰丰饶神赛图恩，他赐予我们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB38BE166BA53FE45","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1510324003:0":{"text":"谁会因为外人的片面之词，就开始质疑信仰？","source_cn":"谁会因为外人的片面之词，就开始质疑信仰？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFEB383C131956B2F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1510324004:0":{"text":"我知道，让人相信自己正在遭受的灾厄竟然来源于所信之神，不是易事。","source_cn":"我知道，让人相信自己正在遭受的灾厄竟然来源于所信之神，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFCF43E159336B9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1510324005:0":{"text":"但如果真的见到丰饶神对呼临的领土和他的信众做了什么……你会承认吗？珀尔修斯？如果事实真的摆在你眼前？","source_cn":"但如果真见到丰饶神对呼临的领土和他的信众做了什么……你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57A620AFA069CCA8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1510324006:0":{"text":"光是在这里听你说出这些不敬的词句，已经是对信仰的亵渎。","source_cn":"光是在这里听你说出这些不敬的词句，已经是对信仰的亵渎。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E734D6046F9A02B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1510324007:0":{"text":"但我愿意给你机会，女士。因为你依照约定，带回了我们被俘的人。","source_cn":"但我愿意给你机会，女士。因为你依照约定，带回了我们被俘的人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69DC94DB266BEFA5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1510324008:0":{"text":"我在为两族的和平而努力。","source_cn":"我在为两族的和平而努力。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0781B499A40520E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1510324009:0":{"text":"为什么一定要让我们和兽人握手言和呢？你和他们并无利益相关。","source_cn":"为什么一定要让我们和兽人握手言和呢？你和他们并无利益相关。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82EEC4BC49E59699","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1510324010:0":{"text":"因为扩张和掠夺无法解决你们的苦难！水泽营地附近原本茂盛的植被在你们到来后已经开始枯萎，连针蝗都开始出现。","source_cn":"因为扩张和掠夺无法解决你们的苦难！水泽营地附近原本茂盛...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79C7C7881EC5EBB9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1510324011:0":{"text":"难道你们没有发现？","source_cn":"难道你们没有发现？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x73E39D414899545E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1510324012:0":{"text":"……那证明不了任何事。","source_cn":"……那证明不了任何事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40482BC6416C56CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1510324013:0":{"text":"你们把对丰饶神的信仰带入了水泽营地，这片交界地，所以堕神的影响也随之而来。","source_cn":"你们把对丰饶神的信仰带入了水泽营地，这片交界地，所以堕...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EF5182353A6878A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1510324014:1":{"text":"请睁开双眼仔细看看吧，你们信仰的丰饶神已经堕落，苦难的根源就在呼临内部。","source_cn":"请睁开双眼仔细看看吧，你们信仰的丰饶神已经堕落，苦难的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA545288068477D5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1510324015:0":{"text":"将你们的刀剑和长矛调转方向，终结堕神，呼临城的生命才会迎来转机。","source_cn":"将你们的刀剑和长矛调转方向，终结堕神，呼临城的生命才会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB74F533A471CFAA4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1510324016:0":{"text":"女士，你说得言之凿凿，仿佛亲眼见过神明堕落一样。","source_cn":"女士，你说得言之凿凿，仿佛亲眼见过神明堕落